sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as Customer
    participant P as product-detail.js
    participant A as api.js
    participant C as ProductController
    participant S as ProductService
    participant D as MongoDB

    U->>P: Type a quantity, click Check availability
    P->>A: apiCheckStock(productId, quantity)
    A->>C: GET /products/ID/stock?quantity=N
    C->>S: checkStock(id, quantity)

    alt quantity is below 1
        S-->>C: throws ValidationException
        C-->>A: 400 with error text "Quantity must be at least 1."
    else quantity is valid
        S->>D: findById(id)
        D-->>S: product or nothing
        alt product does not exist
            S-->>C: throws EntityNotFoundException
            C-->>A: 404 with error text
        else product found
            Note over S: inStock = stock above 0<br/>available = stock at least quantity
            S-->>C: StockDTO
            C-->>A: 200 StockDTO as JSON
        end
    end

    alt 200 answer
        A-->>P: StockDTO (productId, stock, inStock, requestedQuantity, available)
        alt inStock is false
            P-->>U: red text "Out of stock."
        else available is true
            P-->>U: green text "N available (M in stock)."
        else not enough
            P-->>U: red text "Not enough stock: N requested, only M left."
        end
    else error answer or server not reachable
        A-->>P: throws ApiError(status, message)
        P-->>U: red text with the backend message
    end

    Note over S,D: Read only. Nothing is reserved or changed.<br/>The stock is checked again by the backend when the item is added to the cart and at checkout.
